          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid strengthening of escalation feedback raises counterparty risk perceptions and prompts liquidity hoarding in euro‑area money markets, directly increasing French banks' wholesale funding spreads and roll‑over costs." />
