          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Stronger reinforcing escalation loops in military and political signaling cause reciprocal measures (expulsions, public condemnations, targeted sanctions) between Berlin and Moscow, directly raising bilateral diplomatic tension." />
