          <attvalue for="35" value="Sharper escalation feedback (more reciprocal military signaling and retaliation) raises perceived risk of technology diversion and military spillover, prompting US and allied policymakers to tighten and more aggressively enforce export controls on advanced semiconductors and AI hardware." />
