          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge of foreign capital chasing AI compute investments (largely domiciled in US/Asia) produces net outflows from French bond and equity markets as investors rebalance into higher-return tech allocations." />
